-- SEO landing pages
insert into public.sunprime_landing_pages (slug, nav_label, eyebrow, meta_title, meta_description, h1_lead, h1_highlight, lead, intro, benefits_heading, benefits, sector, faq_heading, faqs, related, published, sort_order) values ($sunp$commercial-industrial-solar-rooftop-solutions$sunp$, $sunp$Commercial & Industrial Rooftop$sunp$, $sunp$Commercial & industrial solar$sunp$, $sunp$Commercial & Industrial Rooftop Solar | Sunprime Energy Solutions$sunp$, $sunp$Turnkey commercial and industrial rooftop solar for factories, offices, malls and warehouses, with in-house design, EPC, net metering and O&M.$sunp$, $sunp$Commercial and industrial solar rooftop$sunp$, $sunp$solutions engineered for the balance sheet.$sunp$, $sunp$Sunprime Energy Solutions designs, builds, and maintains commercial and industrial solar rooftop solutions that convert idle roof area into a decades-long hedge against rising grid tariffs and demand charges.$sunp$, $sunp$["For a CFO or plant head, commercial rooftop solar is a procurement decision with a twenty-five-year consequence on the P&L. The question is not merely price per watt but whether the plant will hold its yield, stay compliant with net-metering norms, and reduce your effective tariff every billing cycle. Since 2016, Sunprime has engineered every commercial solar system installation as a long-term financial asset, not a one-off supply order.","That discipline is why demanding clients trust us with their roofs. Havells, HPCL, Indraprastha Gas, Aggarwal City Mall, and Unity One Mall Rohini have chosen Sunprime for commercial and industrial solar rooftop projects. Across 43 commissioned plants and 15,000+ kWp delivered, design and EPC are handled in-house, so a single accountable team owns the outcome from feasibility and load study through to commissioning and beyond.","For your facility, that means shadow-analysed layouts that maximise generation on the roof you have, structural designs that respect your building's loading, DISCOM net-metering handled end to end, and Tier-1 modules and inverters specified for 25-year output. The result is a predictable reduction in energy cost that your finance team can model with confidence."]$sunp$::jsonb, $sunp$Why C&I leaders choose Sunprime$sunp$, $sunp$[{"title":"Lower demand charges and tariffs","body":"We size systems against your actual load curve and DISCOM slab, so daytime generation offsets your most expensive units and eases demand charges from the first billing cycle."},{"title":"Proven with marquee clients","body":"Havells, HPCL, Indraprastha Gas, and leading Delhi malls have trusted Sunprime for commercial rooftop solar, giving you the reassurance of a partner tested on serious industrial and commercial roofs."},{"title":"In-house design and EPC","body":"Structural analysis, electrical design, and construction are executed by our own engineers, so the commercial solar system installation you approve is exactly the plant we commission and stand behind."},{"title":"Net-metering handled end to end","body":"Our team manages feasibility, DISCOM liaison, and net-metering paperwork in-house, keeping approvals moving so your commercial and industrial solar rooftop project reaches commissioning without administrative stalls."},{"title":"Yield protected for 25 years","body":"Solar-Log monitoring, performance-ratio SLAs, and preventive O&M keep your solar panels for commercial buildings generating to plan long after installation, protecting the savings your business case depends on."}]$sunp$::jsonb, $sunp$Commercial$sunp$, NULL, $sunp$[{"q":"What are commercial and industrial solar rooftop solutions?","a":"They are grid-tied rooftop solar systems engineered for factories, offices, malls, and warehouses to offset high daytime grid consumption. Sunprime delivers turnkey commercial and industrial solar rooftop solutions covering load study, structural and electrical design, DISCOM net-metering, Tier-1 supply, and 25-year O&M, so your facility gains a single accountable partner from feasibility to generation."},{"q":"How does commercial rooftop solar reduce my electricity cost?","a":"Commercial rooftop solar generates power during working hours when tariffs and demand are highest, offsetting your most expensive grid units and easing demand charges. With net-metering, surplus generation is credited against your bill. Sunprime sizes each system to your actual load curve so savings are realistic and modelled per site, not generic percentages."},{"q":"Which companies trust Sunprime for commercial solar system installation?","a":"Sunprime has delivered commercial solar system installation for Havells, HPCL, Indraprastha Gas, Aggarwal City Mall, and Unity One Mall Rohini, among 43 commissioned plants totalling 15,000+ kWp. This proven base across industrial and commercial roofs means your project is engineered by a team with real field data, not first-time assumptions."},{"q":"Is my roof suitable for solar panels for commercial buildings?","a":"Most RCC, metal, and industrial sheet roofs are suitable once structural loading, orientation, and shadowing are assessed. Sunprime conducts a detailed feasibility study covering roof condition, available area, and your load profile before recommending a design. Request a free feasibility study and we will confirm exactly what your building can support."},{"q":"Who handles net-metering for a commercial and industrial solar rooftop project?","a":"Sunprime handles net-metering in-house, from DISCOM application and technical feasibility to sanction and meter installation. Because our own engineers manage both the design and the paperwork, filings stay compliant and approvals rarely stall, keeping your commercial and industrial solar rooftop project on schedule to commissioning."}]$sunp$::jsonb, $sunp$["industrial-solar-power-plant","rooftop-solar-installation-delhi","solar-epc-company-delhi","industrial-solar-panel-installation-cost"]$sunp$::jsonb, true, 0)
  on conflict (slug) do update set nav_label=excluded.nav_label, eyebrow=excluded.eyebrow, meta_title=excluded.meta_title, meta_description=excluded.meta_description, h1_lead=excluded.h1_lead, h1_highlight=excluded.h1_highlight, lead=excluded.lead, intro=excluded.intro, benefits_heading=excluded.benefits_heading, benefits=excluded.benefits, sector=excluded.sector, faq_heading=excluded.faq_heading, faqs=excluded.faqs, related=excluded.related, published=excluded.published, sort_order=excluded.sort_order;
insert into public.sunprime_landing_pages (slug, nav_label, eyebrow, meta_title, meta_description, h1_lead, h1_highlight, lead, intro, benefits_heading, benefits, sector, faq_heading, faqs, related, published, sort_order) values ($sunp$rooftop-solar-installation-delhi$sunp$, $sunp$Rooftop Solar in Delhi NCR$sunp$, $sunp$Delhi NCR rooftop solar$sunp$, $sunp$Rooftop Solar Installation in Delhi NCR | Sunprime Energy Solutions$sunp$, $sunp$Plan and install rooftop solar in Delhi NCR with site assessment, system design, net metering support, commissioning and long-term O&M from Sunprime.$sunp$, $sunp$Rooftop solar installation across Delhi NCR,$sunp$, $sunp$engineered and executed locally.$sunp$, $sunp$Sunprime Energy Solutions delivers rooftop solar installation across Delhi NCR, with BSES and Tata Power-DDL net-metering handled in-house and every plant engineered by a local team for the capital's grid.$sunp$, $sunp$["Rooftop solar installation in Delhi NCR is a twenty-five-year commitment tied to a specific grid, and local execution is what separates a plant that performs from one that disappoints. The panels matter, but so do net-metering compliance with BSES and Tata Power-DDL, structural design for local roofs, and an O&M team close enough to keep generation on plan. Since 2016, Sunprime has treated every Delhi NCR rooftop as a long-term asset.","The rooftop solar companies in Delhi NCR that earn lasting trust are the ones institutions return to. Eight Delhi University colleges, including Hindu, Hansraj, Miranda House, and St. Stephen's, along with SRCC, PGDAV, and many Delhi schools, have chosen Sunprime, part of 43 commissioned projects and 15,000+ kWp delivered. Design and EPC are handled in-house, so one accountable team owns your project from feasibility through commissioning.","For a Delhi NCR property, that means net-metering-compliant designs tuned to BSES and Tata Power-DDL requirements, DISCOM filings managed by our own engineers, Tier-1 modules and inverters, and a nearby O&M relationship that protects your generation for the full life of the plant. It is rooftop solar built to keep producing, not just to be installed."]$sunp$::jsonb, $sunp$Why Delhi NCR trusts Sunprime$sunp$, $sunp$[{"title":"Tuned to Delhi's grid","body":"Net-metering designs built to BSES and Tata Power-DDL requirements, with DISCOM filings handled by our own engineers so approvals never stall your rooftop solar installation."},{"title":"Local execution, local accountability","body":"As a Nehru Place-based EPC firm, our engineering and O&M teams are close to your Delhi NCR site, so installation, service, and support arrive quickly rather than through distant subcontractors."},{"title":"Trusted by Delhi institutions","body":"Eight DU colleges including Hindu, Hansraj, Miranda House, and St. Stephen's, plus SRCC and many Delhi schools, have chosen Sunprime, giving you proof tested on the capital's most demanding institutional roofs."},{"title":"In-house design and EPC","body":"Structural analysis, electrical design, and construction are done by our own team, so the rooftop solar plant you approve is exactly the one we commission across Delhi NCR."},{"title":"Generation protected for 25 years","body":"Solar-Log monitoring, performance-ratio SLAs, and preventive maintenance keep your Delhi NCR rooftop plant producing to plan long after the installation is complete."}]$sunp$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $sunp$[{"q":"Who does the best rooftop solar installation in Delhi NCR?","a":"The best installer is the one that engineers for long-term generation and services it locally. Sunprime is an ISO 9001-certified, Nehru Place-based EPC firm with 15,000+ kWp across 43 projects, in-house design and EPC, BSES and Tata Power-DDL net-metering expertise, and 25-year O&M. Judge on engineering depth and local service, not price alone."},{"q":"Which rooftop solar companies in Delhi NCR do institutions trust?","a":"Eight Delhi University colleges, including Hindu, Hansraj, Miranda House, and St. Stephen's, along with SRCC, PGDAV, and many Delhi schools, have chosen Sunprime among rooftop solar companies in Delhi NCR. This institutional track record reflects engineering and O&M dependable enough for large, high-visibility campuses."},{"q":"How does net-metering work for rooftop solar in Delhi NCR?","a":"Under net-metering, your rooftop plant feeds surplus generation to the grid and you are credited against consumption, subject to BSES or Tata Power-DDL norms. Sunprime handles the entire DISCOM application, technical feasibility, and meter installation in-house, keeping your filing compliant and your approval on schedule."},{"q":"How long does rooftop solar installation in Delhi NCR take?","a":"Timelines depend on system size, roof readiness, and DISCOM net-metering approval, which our in-house team manages to avoid delays. After feasibility and design sign-off, most rooftop installations progress efficiently to commissioning. Request a free feasibility study and Sunprime will give you a realistic schedule for your specific Delhi NCR site."},{"q":"Is my Delhi NCR rooftop suitable for solar installation?","a":"Most RCC and institutional roofs across Delhi NCR are suitable once orientation, shading, and structural loading are assessed. Sunprime conducts a detailed feasibility study covering roof condition, available area, and your load profile before recommending a design tuned to BSES or Tata Power-DDL net-metering for your location."}]$sunp$::jsonb, $sunp$["solar-company-delhi","solar-epc-company-delhi","residential-solar-installation","commercial-industrial-solar-rooftop-solutions"]$sunp$::jsonb, true, 1)
  on conflict (slug) do update set nav_label=excluded.nav_label, eyebrow=excluded.eyebrow, meta_title=excluded.meta_title, meta_description=excluded.meta_description, h1_lead=excluded.h1_lead, h1_highlight=excluded.h1_highlight, lead=excluded.lead, intro=excluded.intro, benefits_heading=excluded.benefits_heading, benefits=excluded.benefits, sector=excluded.sector, faq_heading=excluded.faq_heading, faqs=excluded.faqs, related=excluded.related, published=excluded.published, sort_order=excluded.sort_order;
insert into public.sunprime_landing_pages (slug, nav_label, eyebrow, meta_title, meta_description, h1_lead, h1_highlight, lead, intro, benefits_heading, benefits, sector, faq_heading, faqs, related, published, sort_order) values ($sunp$solar-panel-subsidy$sunp$, $sunp$Solar Subsidy & Compliance$sunp$, $sunp$Solar subsidy advisory$sunp$, $sunp$Commercial Solar Subsidy in Delhi | Sunprime Energy Solutions$sunp$, $sunp$Get guidance on commercial and industrial solar subsidy eligibility, DISCOM approvals, net metering and documentation for projects in Delhi NCR.$sunp$, $sunp$Your commercial solar power plant subsidy,$sunp$, $sunp$assessed and filed.$sunp$, $sunp$Sunprime helps Delhi and pan-India businesses understand their commercial solar power plant subsidy eligibility, capture accelerated-depreciation benefits, and clear DISCOM net-metering without the paperwork stalling the project.$sunp$, $sunp$["A commercial solar power plant subsidy can meaningfully change project economics, but eligibility depends on your entity type, connection category, and how the system is designed and metered. Sunprime works as your subsidy and compliance partner, assessing which state and central subsidy schemes and capital or accelerated-depreciation benefits your project can genuinely claim — before you commit — so the financial case you plan around is one that will hold up.","The value most owners overlook is the paperwork itself. A solar plant only earns its incentives once DISCOM net-metering is sanctioned and statutory filings are cleared, and those approvals sit on the critical path. As an experienced solar subsidy consultant in Delhi, Sunprime prepares and files the documentation in-house — feasibility, load and metering data, net-metering applications, and depreciation-ready records — so approvals move in parallel with engineering rather than delaying commissioning.","We are honest about what applies to you. Rather than quote headline percentages that may not fit your case, our engineers and advisory team map your specific eligibility, model the after-incentive returns, and document everything your accountants and lenders need. Backed by 43 commissioned plants and 15,000+ kWp for clients including Havells, HPCL, and industrial and institutional users, we have handled DISCOM and statutory processes across ten states."]$sunp$::jsonb, $sunp$How Sunprime handles your solar subsidy and compliance$sunp$, $sunp$[{"title":"Eligibility assessed before you commit","body":"We map your entity, connection category, and site against the state and central subsidy schemes and depreciation benefits that genuinely apply, so your financial case rests on incentives you can actually claim."},{"title":"Depreciation benefits captured","body":"Our advisory team structures the project so your accountants can claim capital and accelerated-depreciation benefits, and we provide the documentation lenders and auditors expect for an industrial solar installation."},{"title":"DISCOM net-metering handled in-house","body":"Net-metering sanction sits on the critical path. Sunprime prepares and files the applications and metering documentation directly, so approvals progress alongside engineering instead of delaying your plant."},{"title":"Paperwork off the critical path","body":"Feasibility records, load data, statutory filings, and subsidy documentation are managed by our own team, keeping compliance from stalling commissioning or holding up your commercial solar investment."},{"title":"Honest, documented modelling","body":"We model after-incentive returns on your actual figures rather than headline percentages, and hand over records your finance team and lenders can rely on for approvals."}]$sunp$::jsonb, NULL, NULL, $sunp$[{"q":"Is there a subsidy for a commercial solar power plant?","a":"Commercial and industrial projects may access state and central subsidy schemes along with capital and accelerated-depreciation benefits, but eligibility depends on your entity, connection category, and system design. Sunprime assesses exactly what your project qualifies for before you commit. Request a free subsidy assessment to know your position."},{"q":"How does a solar subsidy consultant in Delhi help my business?","a":"A subsidy consultant maps your eligibility, structures the project to capture depreciation benefits, and handles DISCOM net-metering and statutory filings. Sunprime does this in-house alongside engineering, so paperwork stays off the critical path and your incentives are documented for accountants and lenders."},{"q":"What is the industrial solar panel subsidy for factories?","a":"Industrial users can typically combine applicable subsidy schemes with accelerated-depreciation benefits, though the exact position depends on your load, tariff category, and metering. Rather than quote a fixed figure, Sunprime assesses your specific eligibility and models the after-incentive returns on your own numbers."},{"q":"Does Sunprime handle the DISCOM net-metering paperwork?","a":"Yes. Sunprime prepares and files net-metering applications, load and metering documentation, and statutory paperwork in-house. Because these approvals sit on the critical path, handling them directly means sanctions move in parallel with engineering rather than delaying your plant's commissioning."},{"q":"How much subsidy will I actually receive on my solar plant?","a":"The honest answer is that it depends on your entity, connection category, and how the system is designed and metered — so Sunprime assesses your case first rather than promising a headline percentage. We then model realistic after-incentive returns. Book a free feasibility and subsidy assessment to see your numbers."}]$sunp$::jsonb, $sunp$["solar-company-delhi","commercial-industrial-solar-rooftop-solutions","residential-solar-installation","solar-epc-company-delhi"]$sunp$::jsonb, true, 2)
